Oh mec !

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.380
J'ai envie d'en commander un !

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.100
Mec j'suis en train de le commander

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:28.720
Non mais vraiment !

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:29.460
